# cerne.pro brand theme for Ghostty — "heartwood core" (dark)
# Tokens from ~/Documents/design-guidelines.
#
# WCAG contrast pass: red(1)/blue(4)/magenta(5)/bright-red(9) were all
# below 4.5:1 against the ink background (red as low as 2.56:1 — oxblood
# is a brand background/depth color, not meant as foreground text; see
# the guidelines' own "not for body text" rule). Brightened tints used
# here for the ANSI text slots; ink/surface/heartwood/sapwood themselves
# were already >=5:1 and are unchanged.

